      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VALEDICTORIAN (1) is progressing well scoring last time out (19.83) at this track and bringing up his 12th career win. Has a good record here at this journey. One of the key runners again. LAYTON MAGIC (3) continues to race in super honest form hitting the frame at six of 21 starts runs and has won two of last three, the latest winning (25.09) over 450m at Maitland. Tends to go well on this box draw. Rates a winning chance on best. PAW LILIBET (2) clocked a decent 22.78 finishing second in a Grade 4/5 at Wagga last start. This is tougher but looks a leading chance again. AUSSIE BLEND (5) was well backed last start but ran below expectations when fourth (21.08), beaten 4.5 lengths. Some good form is emerging from his last run.",
